   "text": "The SAME flow serves all six URLs:\nsd1/sd2/sd3 x /h1 -> helloworld1\nsd1/sd2/sd3 x /h2 -> helloworld2\n\nSteps 1-3 differ only in which\ncert SNI selects; step 4 is where\nhost+path fan out to a service.",
